# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated outputs. See docs/ARTIFACTS.md for the full tracking policy:
#   tracked   -> results/ (curated aggregate evidence), examples/ (synthetic)
#   released  -> model weights and full per-record bundles (GitHub Releases)
#   ignored   -> everything a command regenerates locally (below)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Local training outputs (best.pt, last.pt, logs, manifests, curves)
checkpoints/
# Local evaluation, policy and audit outputs
artifacts/
# Local copies of remote (e.g. Runpod) training runs
runpod-results/
# Generated figures and exploration output
figures/
exploration_viewer.html
# Downloaded or locally built release bundles
release/
*.log
!results/**/*.log
*.tmp
# Resume checkpoints anywhere (~150 MB, above GitHub's 100 MB file limit)
**/last.pt

# PTB-XL raw dataset (~1GB, regenerable from PhysioNet)
# (no trailing slash, so a symlink to the dataset is ignored too)
ptb-xl-a-large-publicly-available-electrocardiography-dataset-1.0.3
*.dat
*.hea

# Dataset checksums / changelogs (ship with dataset, not this repo)
SHA256SUMS.txt
ptbxl_v*_changelog.txt
